Snowflake DBT Project Deployment + Unix Trigger Demo
Slide 1 — High Level Implementation Design
Current design:
Unix server → ordered SQL files → Snowflake execution
Proposed design:
Unix server → Snowflake (private key auth) → Execute DBT PROJECT → Snowflake DBT models → Tables/Components:
- Snowflake Workspace (DBT development)
- Deployable DBT PROJECT object
- Snowflake Task (optional scheduler)
- Unix server trigger
- Private key authentication
- Monitoring in Snowflake UI
Slide 2 — Current Monolithic SQL Execution Problem
- SQLs executed in order.json
- Unix server controls execution
- No lineage
- No modular deployment
- Hard rollback
- No model-level rerun
- Difficult debugging
Slide 3 — Target Architecture
Developer → Snowflake Workspace → DBT Models
Deploy → DBT PROJECT object (schema level)
Execution → EXECUTE DBT PROJECT
Scheduling → Snowflake TASK
Unix trigger → SnowSQL using private key
Slide 4 — Create DBT Project in Snowflake
Workspace (UI Steps)
1. Go to Snowflake Snowsight
2. Navigate to Projects / Workspaces
3. Create New Workspace
4. Select DBT Project
5. Provide Database, Schema, Role, Warehouse
6. Create project
7. Add models under models folder
8. Validate project
Slide 5 — Example DBT Model
{{ config(materialized='table') }}
select * from RAW.ORDERS
Slide 6 — Deploy DBT Project
Workspace → Deploy
Provide Project name, Database, Schema, Target
Click Deploy
Slide 7 — Verify Deployable DBT Object
SHOW DBT PROJECTS IN SCHEMA MY_DB.MY_SCHEMA;
DESCRIBE DBT PROJECT MY_DB.MY_SCHEMA.MY_DBT_PROJECT;
Slide 8 — Run DBT Project
EXECUTE DBT PROJECT MY_DB.MY_SCHEMA.MY_DBT_PROJECT
ARGS='run --target dev';
Slide 9 — Create Snowflake Task
CREATE OR REPLACE TASK RUN_DBT_PROJECT
WAREHOUSE = DBT_WH
SCHEDULE = 'USING CRON 0 6 * * * America/New_York'
AS
EXECUTE DBT PROJECT MY_DB.MY_SCHEMA.MY_DBT_PROJECT
ARGS='build --target prod';
ALTER TASK RUN_DBT_PROJECT RESUME;
Slide 10 — Unix Shell Script
snowsql -a <account>
-u <user>
--private-key-path /keys/rsa_key.p8
-r DBT_ROLE
-w DBT_WH
-d MY_DB
-s MY_SCHEMA
-q "EXECUTE DBT PROJECT MY_DB.MY_SCHEMA.MY_DBT_PROJECT ARGS='build --target prod';"


